BAB X

SANKSI ADMINISTRATIF

Pasal 40

1. Barang siapa orang atau lembaga atau badan yang dengan sengaja tidak memberikan perlindungan terhadapa perempuan sehingga meyebabkan terjadinya tindak kekerasan terhadap perempuan, membiarkan terjadinya tindak kekerasan, dan/atau tidak melaporkan kepada instansi terkait dapat dikenai sanksi administratif.
2. Badan Usaha atau lembaga swadaya masyarakat wajib memberikan Perlindungan terhadap Perempuan dan tindak Kekerasan dilingkungan tempat kerjanya.
3. Badan Usaha atau lembaga swadaya masyarakat wajib melaporkan tindak kekerasan dilingkungan tempat kerjanya kepada instansi terkait.
4. Pelanggaran sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1), ayat (2) dan ayat (3) dapat dikenai sanksi administratif berupa:a. peringatan lisan;
b. peringatan tertulis;
c. penghentian sementara dari kegiatan;
d. pemutusan kerjasama;
e. pencabutan surat keterangan terdaftar;
f. pencabutan izin operasional;
g. pensegelan;
h. penarikan fasilitas; dan/ataui. denda administratif paling sedikit Rp.10.000.000,-(Sepuluh Juta Rupiah) dan paling banyak Rp. 50.000.000,-(Lima Puluh Juta Rupiah) (5) Ketentuan mengenai tata cara penerapan sanksi administratif sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (4) diatur dalam Peraturan Bupati.

translated_text:
CHAPTER X

ADMINISTRATIVE SANCTIONS

Article 40

1. Any person or institution or entity that deliberately fails to provide protection to women resulting in acts of violence against women, allows violence to occur, and/or fails to report to the relevant authority may be subject to administrative sanctions.
2. Business Entities or non-governmental organizations shall provide Protection to Women and against Violence in their workplace environment.
3. Business Entities or non-governmental organizations shall report acts of violence in their workplace environment to the relevant authority.
4. Violations as referred to in paragraph (1), paragraph (2) and paragraph (3) may be subject to administrative sanctions in the form of:a. verbal warning;
b. written warning;
c. temporary suspension from activities;
d. termination of cooperation;
e. revocation of registered certificate;
f. revocation of operational license;
g. sealing;
h. withdrawal of facilities; and/ori. administrative fine of at least Rp.10,000,000,-(Ten Million Rupiah) and at most Rp. 50,000,000,-(Fifty Million Rupiah) (5) Provisions regarding the procedures for imposing administrative sanctions as referred to in paragraph (4) shall be regulated in a Regent Regulation.
